Package: bsnow
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: falling-snow desktop effect for V\OS
 BSnow sprinkles animated snow flakes over the desktop view (with a
 fallen-snow strip and a dragger), as a small always-on effect window.
